      "event": "grow",
      "start": 13.953,
      "end": 18.129,
      "file": "lines/recorded/05-grow.m4a",
      "text": "How big they get comes down to three things: wind speed, time, and distance."
    },
    {
      "scene": "03-energy",
      "event": "energy",
      "start": 18.379,
      "end": 21.729,
      "file": "lines/recorded/06-energy.m4a",
      "text": "But a wave isn't water on the move. It's energy."
